 "ConfigureProjectPrompt": {
  "html": "<section class=\"not-prose my-6 rounded-lg border border-border/80 bg-muted/20 p-4\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:justify-between\"><div class=\"max-w-2xl\"><h2 class=\"m-0 text-sm font-medium text-foreground\">Configure with Conductor</h2><p class=\"m-0 mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Open Conductor with the shared settings.toml setup prompt pre-filled, or copy it into an existing workspace.</p></div><div class=\"flex shrink-0 flex-col gap-2 sm:flex-row\"><a href=\"conductor://prompt=Use%20the%20bundled%20Conductor%20skill.%0A%0ARead%20the%20relevant%20docs%3A%0A-%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.conductor.build%2Fdocs%2Freference%2Fsettings%0A-%20https%3A%2F%2Fwww.conductor.build%2Fdocs%2Freference%2Fscripts%0A%0AInspect%20this%20repo%20and%20create%20or%20update%20the%20%60.conductor%2Fsettings.local.toml%60%20file%20in%20the%20repo%20root%20with%20the%20best%20local%20Conductor%20config%20for%20this%20repository.%0A%0ARequirements%3A%0A-%20If%20%60.conductor%2Fsettings.local.toml%60%20already%20exists%2C%20preserve%20its%20existing%20settings%20unless%20clearly%20wrong.%0A-%20Inspect%20%60.conductor%2Fsettings.toml%60%20if%20it%20exists%2C%20but%20treat%20it%20as%20inherited%20shared%20defaults.%20Do%20not%20edit%20or%20duplicate%20shared%20settings%20unless%20a%20local%20override%20is%20needed.%0A-%20Stamp%20the%20schema%20at%20the%20top%20for%20validation%3A%20%60%22%24schema%22%20%3D%20%22https%3A%2F%2Fconductor.build%2Fschemas%2Fsettings.repo.schema.json%22%60.%0A-%20Configure%20the%20%60%5Bscripts%5D%60%20table%20as%20fully%20as%20makes%20sense%3B%20baseline%20is%20a%20setup%20script%20with%20%60scripts.setup%60%2C%20plus%20%60scripts.run%60%20and%20%60scripts.archive%60.%0A-%20Follow%20the%20repo's%20existing%20package%20manager%2C%20scripts%2C%20and%20setup%20conventions.%0A-%20Keep%20commands%20simple%2C%20non-interactive%2C%20non-destructive%2C%20and%20workspace-safe.%0A-%20Use%20%60CONDUCTOR_PORT%60%20for%20actions%20(%60scripts.run%60)%20when%20the%20project%20supports%20configurable%20ports.%0A-%20Set%20%60scripts.run_mode%60%20if%20concurrency%20behavior%20is%20clear.%0A-%20Use%20the%20%60%5Bscripts%5D%60%20table%20in%20%60.conductor%2Fsettings.local.toml%60%3B%20do%20not%20create%20a%20legacy%20%60conductor.json%60%20file.%0A-%20Recommend%20%60.conductor%2Fsettings.toml%60%20only%20when%20the%20user%20explicitly%20wants%20a%20shared%2C%20committed%20team%20default.%0A%0AInspect%20the%20usual%20sources%3A%20package%20files%2C%20lockfiles%2C%20README%2Fcontributing%20docs%2C%20Makefile%2Fjustfile%2Ftaskfile%2C%20Docker%2FProcfile%20config%2C%20and%20existing%20%60scripts%2F%60%20or%20%60bin%2F%60.%0A%0AAfter%20editing%2C%20validate%20the%20TOML%20and%20summarize%20what%20you%20configured%2C%20why%2C%20what%20remains%20inherited%20from%20shared%20settings%2C%20and%20one%20quick%20Conductor%20test%20I%20can%20run.\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-foreground/35 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-foreground text-background hover:bg-foreground/90 font-medium px-3 py-4 text-sm gap-2 rounded-md h-9\">Open Conductor<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap ring-offset-background focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-foreground/35 focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border border-border bg-background/50 backdrop-blur-md hover:bg-secondary hover:text-secondary-foreground font-medium px-3 py-4 text-sm gap-2 rounded-md h-9\" type=\"button\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy size-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg>Copy prompt</button></div></div><details class=\"mt-4 rounded-md border border-border/70 bg-background\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer px-3 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground\">View prompt</summary><pre class=\"m-0 max-h-80 overflow-auto whitespace-pre-wrap border-t border-border/70 p-3 text-xs leading-5 text-foreground\">Use the bundled Conductor skill.\n\nRead the relevant docs:\n- https://www.conductor.build/docs/reference/settings\n- https://www.conductor.build/docs/reference/scripts\n\nInspect this repo and create or update the `.conductor/settings.local.toml` file in the repo root with the best local Conductor config for this repository.\n\nRequirements:\n- If `.conductor/settings.local.toml` already exists, preserve its existing settings unless clearly wrong.\n- Inspect `.conductor/settings.toml` if it exists, but treat it as inherited shared defaults. Do not edit or duplicate shared settings unless a local override is needed.\n- Stamp the schema at the top for validation: `\"$schema\" = \"https://conductor.build/schemas/settings.repo.schema.json\"`.\n- Configure the `[scripts]` table as fully as makes sense; baseline is a setup script with `scripts.setup`, plus `scripts.run` and `scripts.archive`.\n- Follow the repo's existing package manager, scripts, and setup conventions.\n- Keep commands simple, non-interactive, non-destructive, and workspace-safe.\n- Use `CONDUCTOR_PORT` for actions (`scripts.run`) when the project supports configurable ports.\n- Set `scripts.run_mode` if concurrency behavior is clear.\n- Use the `[scripts]` table in `.conductor/settings.local.toml`; do not create a legacy `conductor.json` file.\n- Recommend `.conductor/settings.toml` only when the user explicitly wants a shared, committed team default.\n\nInspect the usual sources: package files, lockfiles, README/contributing docs, Makefile/justfile/taskfile, Docker/Procfile config, and existing `scripts/` or `bin/`.\n\nAfter editing, validate the TOML and summarize what you configured, why, what remains inherited from shared settings, and one quick Conductor test I can run.</pre></details></section>",
